## How accessible {{ project_name }} is

{{ project_name }} aims to meet [WCAG 2.2](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/) at level AA.

Its conformance is **not assessed**. Nobody has checked it against every WCAG 2.2 criterion, and
there has been no external audit. This is a self-assessment by the developer. What is checked,
and how, is under How we check.

